{"id":"4265af5de6457d74","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-circuit-hardness.md","title":"Circuit Hardness","display":"df-circuit-hardness — Circuit Hardness","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-circuit-hardness","aliases":["28-df-circuit-hardness"],"type":"definition","display":"df-circuit-hardness — Circuit Hardness","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 19.1; Definition 6.1","source_printed_pages":"375,107","source_pdf_pages":"401,133","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-circuit-hardness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-circuit-hardness</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-hardness — Circuit Hardness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 19.1; Definition 6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"375,107"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"401,133"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(S\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BF}\">\\(\\operatorname{BF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>；非输入门数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>。</li>\n<li>对无限布尔函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(F:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，长度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CircuitCost}(C)\\coloneqq n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CircuitCost}(C)\\coloneqq n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}:\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\operatorname{CircuitCost}(C)\\le S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}:\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\operatorname{CircuitCost}(C)\\le S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\left|\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=f(x)\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\left|\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=f(x)\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\{S\\in\\mathbb N:\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)&lt;\\rho\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\{S\\in\\mathbb N:\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)&lt;\\rho\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f)\\coloneqq H^1_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f)\\coloneqq H^1_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{S\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}:\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)&lt;\\frac12+\\frac1S\\right\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{S\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}:\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)&lt;\\frac12+\\frac1S\\right\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_n\\coloneqq F\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\{0,1\\}^n,\\qquad H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F_n),\\qquad H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(F_n),\\qquad H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_n\\coloneqq F\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\{0,1\\}^n,\\qquad H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F_n),\\qquad H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(F_n),\\qquad H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 19.1（印刷375页，PDF401页）的阈值使用严格小于；本节点保留该严格性。原书6.1将输入顶点计入大小，故这里用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\">\\(n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\)</span> 补偿本目录 size 只数非输入门的约定。</p>\n<p>良定义性：每个本地电路至少有一个顶点，故预算零的测试集为空，第一处最大值候选至少含零。任意布尔函数有有限 DNF 电路精确计算；预算达到该电路大小后，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\le1\">\\(\\rho\\le1\\)</span> 的严格不等式失败，故候选有界。第二处最大值同理：预算足够大且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\ge2\">\\(S\\ge2\\)</span> 时精确电路不满足严格不等式。直接写出第二个最大值也补足了原书简写在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=1\">\\(S=1\\)</span> 时调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^{3/2}_{\\mathrm{avg}}\">\\(H^{3/2}_{\\mathrm{avg}}\\)</span> 超出先前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1]\\)</span> 声明的边界；此处没有该调用。</p>\n<p>为支持混合论证的零长度前缀，测试类与硬度也覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>；这时函数有唯一输入、常量门给出有限精确电路，以上存在性论证仍成立。本地测试类沿用 BF，允许常量门与不超过二的 AND/OR 扇入；原书6.1要求精确二扇入。这些模型渐近等价，但定量常数不能无条件互换；后续 Yao 节点显式给出模型转换开销。已核对定义陈述，未宣称核验本章全部证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$、$\\operatorname{BF}$、$\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；非输入门数 $\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$、$\\operatorname{BF}$、$\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；非输入门数 $\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CircuitCost}(C)\\coloneqq n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\qquad(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}:\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\operatorname{CircuitCost}(C)\\le S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)\\coloneqq2^{-n}\\left|\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=f(x)\\}\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\{S\\in\\mathbb N:\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)<\\rho\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f)\\coloneqq H^1_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f).","display":true},{"tex":"H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{S\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}:\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_n(S)\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_n(C,f)<\\frac12+\\frac1S\\right\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"F_n\\coloneqq F\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\{0,1\\}^n,\\qquad H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H^\\rho_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F_n),\\qquad H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(F_n),\\qquad H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F)(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(F_n).","display":true},{"tex":"n+\\operatorname{size}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\le1","display":false},{"tex":"S\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"S=1","display":false},{"tex":"H^{3/2}_{\\mathrm{avg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":3192,"backlinks":[{"id":"d42ba324c0358975","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\ell\\in\\mathbb N$，$m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$。$U_m$ 为 $\\Sigma^m$ 上均匀分布；$\\Pr$ 为有限概率空间上的概率。\n$\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)$ 与 $\\operatorname{out}_C$ 的接口见 [[28-df-circuit-hardness]]：测试电路为有界扇入、单比特输出电路，预算计入输入节点。\n$C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{m,1}$；$R:\\Sigma^m\\to[0,1]$ 是概率质量函数，$\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^m}R(y)=1$。$G(U_\\ell)$ 表示函数 $G:\\Sigma^\\ell\\to\\Sigma^m$ 对均匀种子的推前分布。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"},{"id":"ea7158d315318373","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma$；$f_n=f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n$；$S\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，其中 $\\mathrm{TC}$ 见 [[28-df-time-constructible]]。\n$H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f_n)$、$H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f_n)$ 使用 [[28-df-circuit-hardness]] 中总节点数电路硬度；$\\operatorname{DPRG}$ 使用 [[28-df-derandomization-prg]] 的渐近定义。$\\mathrm{TM},M(x),\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 也由后者的直接机器接口确定；$\\langle b\\rangle$ 为比特 $b$ 对应的单字符输出串。"},{"id":"d576ea6347595034","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\epsilon>2(1-\\delta)^k$；硬度和电路模型见 [[28-df-circuit-hardness]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600"]}